+    USGS/EPA Water Quality Portal &middot; CPCB NWMP via OpenCity.<br>
+    Multi-band risk fusion: worst-parameter escalation with weighted score tie-break;
+    drift via MAD robust z-scores on the pond's own 14-day baseline.</div>
